      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Components:\n    - the javascript that runs in the browser that \n        encapsulates and area of UI\n    - in angular, we create components in sounce code:\n        -  a typescript class with \"metadata\" that Angular understands.\n        - a template (looks like HTML, it isn't)\n        - and some css\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Components:\n    - the javascript that runs in the browser that \n        encapsulates and area of UI\n    - in angular, we create components in sounce code:\n        -  a typescript class with \"metadata\" that Angular understands.\n        - a template (looks like HTML, it isn't)\n        - and some css\n",
